  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop or crush garlic. In a medium saucepan, melt the butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat.\n• Cook garlic until fragrant, 1-2 mins. Add rice, water (for the rice) and a generous pinch of salt and bring to the boil. Reduce heat to low and cover with a lid. Cook for 10 mins, then remove from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and the water absorbed, 10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6363e7d1669301ad850e6385/step-4b6d3ba2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, drain sweetcorn. Roughly chop tomato and baby spinach.\n• Heat a large frying pan over high heat. Cook sweetcorn until charred, 5-6 mins. Transfer to a bowl and add tomato and spinach. Lightly drizzle with white wine vinegar and toss to combine. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6363e7d1669301ad850e6385/step-e6f1e3fa.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Drain and rinse black beans.\n• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook black beans and spicy taco seasoning (add less if you're sensitive to heat!) until fragrant and tender, 2-3 mins.\n• Stir through tomato paste (see ingredients) and water (for the sauce) and cook until slightly reduced, 1 min. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6363e7d1669301ad850e6385/step-71190b7c.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide garlic rice between bowls and top with Mexican beans and salsa.\n• Sprinkle with Cheddar cheese.\n• Serve with sour cream and tear over coriander. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6363e7d1669301ad850e6385/step-7dc953d1.jpg"
    }
  ]
